Subject: [PATCH 4/6] WP-0.7, enforcement (cld-advisor's series 3, patch 4;
 built on b80c68991 with series 2 applied): A REPOSITORY WITH NO COMMIT IS NOT
 A FULL CLONE (main's unseen case U9.b, B1890; the rule of series 1). A folder
 made a repository with 'git init', holding an export's files and no commit,
 was its own top level, so checkout_state read it as a full clone; the four
 debt gates were refused for want of a commit to take a day from, and nine
 gates of the table passed with nothing to look at. It is PV9 with git present
 and silent, and none of the seat's twelve variants tried it. checkout_state
 now has two more words. 'empty': a repository that holds no commit, or whose
 commit holds no file. 'untracked': a repository whose commit does not hold
 the gates that are being run; this is the seat's own variant of main's case,
 a note committed and the whole tree beside it untracked, where git has
 something to say about something else and eight gates of the table passed.
 Every gate of the table is refused on either, in plain words, as on an
 export. Four forms are locked, each an export's files in a fresh repository:
 no commit; the files added and not committed; an empty commit with the files
 beside it; a commit that holds a note. What it does not reach: a tree that is
 partly tracked, where the gates are committed and other files beside them are
 not; the push hook's clean worktree is what answers that. TWO TESTS OF MAIN'S
 CHANGE, each with a dated note: B1890's lock pins the gap and asks that its
 line be changed in the commit that closes it (it now reads 'empty'; its name
 still says the gap is there, and renaming it is main's); and
 tests/test_gate_failing_paths.py::test_views_generated_fails_when_a_generator_is_missing
 commits its page, since a repository with an index and no commit is now
 refused before the gate looks for its generators. The lock: three tests added
 to tests/test_gates_are_a_function_of_the_commit.py; on the commit before,
 two fail, the first naming seven gates that pass (main saw nine; two of them
 have read the past since series 2 and fail closed). 0 of 19.

